# Milestones

The product surface is [OpenVK `Web/routes.yml`](https://github.com/OpenVK/openvk/blob/master/Web/routes.yml). The page spec is [OpenVK `Web/Presenters/templates`](https://github.com/OpenVK/openvk/tree/master/Web/Presenters/templates). Do not invent a parallel backlog or a second layout.

- A milestone is a **closed URL set** a person can finish without a stub: permalink, API, 2007 page, privacy.
- Cluster by **handler family** (Wall, Photos, Audio), not by crate or component.
- Browser paths follow OpenVK grammar (`/id{num}`, `/wall{owner}_{local}`, `/album{o}_{n}`, `/im/sel{num}`). REST under `/api/v1` is internal.
- Order: site chrome → wall → people → photos → audio → video → clubs → mail → search → secondary (notes/docs/replies).
- Not product milestones: themepacks, admin, VK API, support desk, coins, reports.
- `/feed` is friends’ wall posts, not a microblog.
- 2007 is the site. Appearance is default/dark only.

When planning or implementing, name the URLs in the slice and the exit criteria. Do not start the next family until the current URL set is closable.
